          "id": "speech_ai_engineer_acoustic_feature_extraction",
          "name": "Acoustic Feature Extraction",
          "tag": "essential",
          "description": "Master the extraction of key acoustic features such as Spectrograms, Mel-spectrograms, MFCCs (Mel-Frequency Cepstral Coefficients), Perceptual Linear Prediction (PLP), Linear Predictive Coding (LPC), and prosodic features (pitch, energy, duration). Understand their properties, delta and delta-delta coefficients, and applications in speech modeling.",
